# Aston Martin DB7 V12 Vantage coupe, 1999-2003 (DB7 range 1994-2004).
#
# The Ian Callum DB7 coupe, built at Bloxham on a steel monocoque. This object
# models the V12 Vantage the reference pack photographs: the 5.9-litre V12 with
# the larger grille, the louvred bonnet and the V12 Vantage wheels. The
# six-cylinder DB7 of 1994-99 has a different grille and bonnet and is not
# separately represented; the DB7 Volante is a different body.
# https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Aston_Martin_DB7
#
# Dimensions 4.646 m (4.692 for the Vantage) x 1.830 m x 1.268 m, wheelbase
# 2.591 m.
#
# Shape reference: a silver V12 Vantage coupe, UK registration, in true side
# elevation, front three-quarter and rear three-quarter. The pack is one car
# throughout, so the three views agree.
#
# Colours: grade (c), from the Aston Martin Heritage Trust's factory paint
# sample book. The 1994 launch palette was Chiltern Green, Mendip Blue,
# Quantock Blue, Cheviot Red, Malvern Silver, Cotswold Gold, Pennine Grey and
# Brecon Black; the four used here are Chiltern Green, Mendip Blue, Cheviot Red
# and Malvern Silver. Weights 3, 3, 2, 2, total 10, provisional.
#
# Speed 265 km/h. Comfort 72/438, on the line 330 + 1.5 x 72: a 2+2 with a
# longer cabin and a more upright screen than the Virage. Classes 3,4.
#
# Dates are road presence: 1994 intro (the range), retires staggered 2012-2016
# on an eighteen- to twenty-two-year tail.
#
# Metres master: citycars/4.5/aston-db7.blend. Interchange:
# citycars/4.5/aston-db7.dae. References:
# citycars/references/aston-db7/ (gitignored; Wikimedia Commons).
#
# Accepted deviations: the side glazing is more angular than the car's, and the
# rear lenses read as separate pieces rather than a continuous wraparound
# cluster. The 4.692 m Vantage length is used; the six-cylinder DB7's grille and
# bonnet are not represented. At 128 px the long bonnet, oval lamps, curved
# roofline and wraparound tail read as a DB7.

obj=citycar
name=AstonDB7(ChilternGreen)
copyright=JamesPetts

DistributionWeight=3
intro_year=1994
intro_month=9
retire_year=2016
retire_month=6
speed=265
length=3
class=3,4
maximum_comfortable_journey_minutes=72
maximum_tolerable_journey_minutes=438

